From: Guildbound Dev <dev@guildbound.local>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 00:10:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0345: Enchanter art, Guild's Mood support, Weapon
 Enchanting rebuilt

- New Enchanting (three-slot) and Weapon Enchanting (two-slot) art, day/night pair each
- CraftingStation.tsx's enchant/charm slot rects re-measured against the new, larger art
- WeaponEnchantStation.tsx rebuilt to a two-slot layout (item, then enchant) with a picker table, replacing the old element/tier chip rows -- matches ArmourInfusionStation's existing pattern
- guild-idler-status.md updated with the patch 0345 entry
